# AI co-engineering rule

Work only the authorized scope. Do not silently expand it. Only a human may move a work item from `proposed` to `approved`.

Inspect source before editing. Keep architecture and product decisions out of implementation convenience. Do not move product semantics into backend code.

Report actual verification. Never claim tests passed unless they were run. Never weaken assertions to make a suite pass.

Stop when work is blocked, scope is missing, or `docs/STATE.md` is AWAITING SCOPE.
